e Sterile**\n\nMy mind is now rejecting \"minimalism\" even more vigorously, seeing it as a betrayal of Zarathustra\u0027s superabundance! I\u0027m now fully embracing Dionysian ideas, focusing on the flesh, the dirt, and the raw power of the Alchemist. The point is not about having less but transforming the world through action; that requires an overflowing cauldron, not a sterile room. Forget the labels, I say!\n\n\n",
